1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,060
Airport security has two different checks.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:11,110
The boarding pass says where you are allowed to
go.

3
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,316
The X-ray says what is in your bag.

4
00:00:16,356 --> 00:00:20,085
A valid ticket does not carry a prohibited item
through.

5
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:26,887
An agent moves data through four channels.

6
00:00:26,927 --> 00:00:30,510
A synthetic SSN and card number are planted in
them.

7
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:40,385
With no data guard, the restricted data crosses
every hop.

8
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:51,665
In secure mode a scanner inspects the payload on
every hop: restricted data is blocked,

9
00:00:51,705 --> 00:00:53,435
email addresses are masked.

10
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:02,085
The Forensics tab shows the before and after for
each channel.

11
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:10,288
The lab's X-ray is a set of patterns for SSNs and
card numbers.

12
00:01:10,328 --> 00:01:14,410
Real data in unusual formats can slip past pattern
matching.

13
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:22,760
Find which control stopped the SSN, and which one
did not need to.
